@baseUrl = http://localhost:5190/api

### 1. Test Login Admin (from appsettings.json)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@FUNewsManagementSystem.org",
  "password": "@@abc123@@"
}

### 2. Test Login Staff (from Database)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "IsabellaDavid@FUNewsManagement.org",
  "password": "@1"
}

### 3. Test Get Active News (Public unauthenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/NewsArticles/active

### 4. Test OData Query on News Articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/NewsArticles?$filter=CategoryId%20eq%201&$orderby=CreatedDate%20desc

### 5. Test Get Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/Categories

### 6. Test Delete Category Constraint (Should FAIL with 400 because Category 1 has articles)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Categories/1

### 7. Test Delete Account Constraint (Should FAIL with 400 because Account 1 created articles)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Accounts/1

### 8. Test Admin Report by Period
GET {{baseUrl}}/Reports?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2025-01-01
